OL,3,AKing's funding for Andrew not to be
OL,4,Aused for legal action against police
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor has been
OL,7,Ftold that the allowance given to him by
OL,8,FKing Charles should not be used to fund
OL,9,Fhis legal action against Thames Valley
OL,10,FPolice and the Central Criminal Court.
OL,12,FThe King uses his own private money to
OL,13,Fsupport his brother and to accommodate
OL,14,Fhim on his estate in Sandringham.
OL,16,FBut a royal source said that this
OL,17,Ffunding should not be used for a legal
OL,18,Fchallenge being launched by
OL,19,FMountbatten-Windsor against the search
OL,20,Fwarrants issued ahead of his arrest in
OL,21,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
