OL,3,AWhat prompted the US bombers to leave
OL,4,ARAF Fairford?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the last seven months, America's
OL,7,FB-1 Lancer bombers and other aircraft
OL,8,Fhave been operating out of Fairford to
OL,9,Fstrike the Iranian missile launch
OL,10,Fsites.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
